    return value


def step(carry, prefix, upstream):
    document = prefix.document_ids[-1]
    old = carry[1] if carry is not None and carry[0] == document else ''
    token = prefix.token_strings[-1]
    value = strength(old, token)
    return (document, (old + token)[-180:]), -value

"""Document-opening pulses and small responses to explicit control markers.

An opening full stop plus newline gives a particularly strong positive pulse.
Other line breaks, capitalized English function words, and indentation have
smaller opening responses. Import/package declarations give a negative one.
A document consisting so far only of carriage returns stays strongly negative.
After the opening, only thought, turn, and tool-boundary markers are modeled;
the many small, word-specific activations of ordinary text are left at zero.
