negative responses of different strengths. Related ph-vowel and h-on spellings
also respond. Explicit rules cover common East Asian writings and kana phone
endings. Two unrelated format rules cover repeated middle dots and an opening
Title: header. Everything else is zero. Carry holds at most 64 recent bytes
and resets between documents.
